      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنَآءٌ قَوْأَبٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوْأَبِىٌّ</span></b>  <i>A vessel that takes,</i> or
<i>receives, much water:</i> (O, K:) the latter epithet
expl. by Lth as signifying <i>taking,</i> or <i>receiving,
much.</i> (L.)

